      "q": "How much does Maximus Federal Services make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Maximus Federal Services obligated $351M in federal contracts in FY2026 to date. Maximus Federal Services received 45 awards so far in the fiscal year and the average award size is $7.8M. Obligations fell down 76.4% year over year, and prior fiscal years registered FY21 $1.4B, FY22 $1.1B, FY23 $1.1B, FY24 $1.1B, and FY25 $1.5B."
